the NYU professor many call the dean of

4
00:00:06,362 --> 00:00:07,268
valuation,

5
00:00:07,628 --> 00:00:09,938
said one share of Anthropic was worth.

6
00:00:10,426 --> 00:00:12,423
He worked it out minutes before the IPO

7
00:00:12,504 --> 00:00:14,176
