146
00:05:07,362 --> 00:05:09,197
the value may flow to all of us,

147
00:05:09,870 --> 00:05:11,704
not to Anthropic's shareholders.

148
00:05:12,378 --> 00:05:14,235
So why hasn't he written it off?

149
00:05:14,300 --> 00:05:15,229
Part five.

150
00:05:15,658 --> 00:05:17,516
Why he might still buy.

151
00:05:18,004 --> 00:05:20,221
Damodaran thinks AI ends up with two or

152
