Never as a big bet.

164
00:05:46,727 --> 00:05:48,781
The same rule applies to Nvidia.

165
00:05:49,071 --> 00:05:51,707
He sold the shares he bought in 2018,

166
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,599
