179
00:06:16,833 --> 00:06:17,936
Part six.

180
00:06:18,296 --> 00:06:19,527
What it means for you.

181
00:06:20,432 --> 00:06:22,754
Ed Elson says that for AI stocks,

182
00:06:22,789 --> 00:06:24,345
